Z||000001||Cozmo||07-29-2001||10:05 AM||||I know about this car...<BR>The owner is an AVID race fan and the car ('88 Formula) is being built using some pretty neat stuff...(brake cooling ducts, periscope rear view mirror, custom skirts etc.).<BR>He has the parts on the car the stickers represent (Koni, Accel etc.). It's in primer now and getting front and rear scoops. When it's done it will be silver with black trim.<BR>The car is "in progress", some crazy ideas but when it's done it'll be NICE.<BR>If I can dig up some pics (they're here somewhere... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) I'll post them.<BR><B>C02M0</B> ||||reg||4
Z||000002||turbo86se||07-29-2001||10:52 AM||||Uh oh, I just thought of something. I've got two small KONI stickers on my SE. They're on the fenders below the trim. I've had them on there for four years, long before the ricing craze. I'm not going to remove them, I think they do look nice. Does this mean my Fiero is slightly riced? Nahh, it does have Koni's, BTW!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>There is a black '85GT running around here, the kid installed a huge spoiler that doesn't look like it belongs on anything. Last I heard he had neon lights inside the car. Poor Fiero. <BR>Worst part is he knows me, yet I don't have a clue who he is. A g/f of mine stopped in where he worked, he started hitting on her and bragging about his Fiero, and talking sh*! about me and my Fieros. Oh well, he's just jealous. If he keeps it up he'll be seeing some blue lights in his rearview! LOL j/k||||reg||1
